{"v":2,"catch":"你陷入進了無限延伸的地下通道。請仔細觀察四周，到達“8號出口”吧。","desc":"請不要放過任何異變的蛛絲馬跡。\n\n若發現異變，請立刻原路返回。\n\n若未發現異變，則不要返回。\n\n請從8號出口離開。\n\n《8號出口》是一款以日本的地下通道、閾限空間、後室等等為靈感的短篇步行模擬遊戲。","publisher":"PLAYISM","release":"2024-04-17","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","葡萄牙文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 3.0GB / Switch 1.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/474d15966c47108230782a66ae1de6b1e8d9c77dde06dc5359924c0f7c059000.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3b3aaddaa26abb59cac9ab9e9aaae21ef48c98e0dcaa862807f0a237e52cd9a8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e1ed7765576d3f2f54696c324f9c818981709fad83fa7f40b7ca32f29e25685.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4f357bf5046662054915e8890cb183d3d9673e5cf08ba78885c33dfc0e5a81ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/106d9875f9995672bd98a8bbfa289c1405a89b99463451a4f1e9aa3fcad32577.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/987195fad23137b5a02b8afd15055e8b0db7ba57c74a38682a2724c2cb5b54b7.jpg"],"titleId":"01003bf01e940000"}